@host = http://localhost:5193
# Cole aqui o token retornado pelo login
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login (admin/admin123 ou usuario/usuario123)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### Usuário logado
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar chamados (filtros opcionais: startDate e endDate [admin, yyyy-MM-dd], departmentId [admin], status, priority, itemName)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=1&priority=3&itemName=impressora
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar chamado
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": 1,
  "itemName": "Impressora HP",
  "description": "Não está imprimindo",
  "priority": 3,
  "equipmentTag": "PAT-0001",
  "tagIds": [2, 3]
}

### Alterar status (admin) - 2 = Em andamento, 3 = Finalizado
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": 2 }

### Cancelar chamado (apenas se Aberto)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Departamentos
GET {{host}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar departamento (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Compras", "color": "#43A047" }

### Tags
GET {{host}}/api/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar tag (admin)
POST {{host}}/api/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Impressora", "color": "#E53935" }
